  - text: "#2026-001 Haunted"
  - heading "Abandoned Springfield Farmhouse" [level=1]
  - paragraph: Springfield, TN, US
  - paragraph: "Opened 03/10/2026 · Client: The Hargrove Family"
  - heading "Summary" [level=5]
  - paragraph: Long-time residents report unexplained activity at an 1890s farmhouse on the outskirts of Springfield. Persistent knocking, temperature anomalies, and apparitions near the barn have been documented over three generations of occupants.
  - heading "Community Rating" [level=5]
  - text: ✓ 5 ✗ 0 ? 0 5 votes +5
  - button "✓ Confirms"
  - button "✗ Disputes"
  - button "? Inconclusive"
  - heading "Timeline" [level=5]
  - text: 03/03/2026 12:00:00 AM Client
  - paragraph: Initial Client Report
  - paragraph: Client contacted us regarding unusual activity at their property in Springfield, TN.
  - text: 03/10/2026 12:00:00 AM Investigator
  - paragraph: Case Opened
  - paragraph: Case accepted for investigation. Preliminary review of client statement complete. Site visit scheduled.
  - text: 03/24/2026 12:00:00 AM Research
  - paragraph: Historical Research — Property Records
  - paragraph: Property records reveal multiple previous owners who each reported similar activity. Oldest documented account dates to 1947.
  - text: IsHaunted.com © 2026
  - link "Help":
    - /url: /help
  - link "Contact":
    - /url: /contact</Message>
